Input: {"question": "Which award did Samuel Yellen receive?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 91, "text": "**Renowned American Novelist Samuel Yellen Honored with Prestigious Guggenheim Fellowship**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 93, "end": 306, "text": "In a testament to his outstanding contributions to American literature, acclaimed novelist Samuel Yellen has been awarded the esteemed Guggenheim Fellowship, a prestigious grant recognizing excellence in the arts."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 307, "end": 519, "text": "Established in 1925, the Guggenheim Fellowship is one of the most coveted honors in the literary world, with past recipients including literary giants such as Ernest Hemingway, Langston Hughes, and Toni Morrison."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 520, "end": 728, "text": "This year, the John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation has selected Samuel Yellen as one of its distinguished fellows, acknowledging his remarkable body of work and commitment to the craft of novel writing."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 729, "end": 831, "text": "\"We are thrilled to recognize Samuel Yellen's remarkable talent and dedication to his craft,\" said Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 832, "end": 906, "text": "Edward Hirsch, President of the John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 907, "end": 1116, "text": "\"His novels have captivated readers with their nuanced exploration of the human experience, and we are confident that this fellowship will enable him to continue pushing the boundaries of literary excellence.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1117, "end": 1223, "text": "Yellen's writing has been praised for its lyrical prose, complex characters, and thought-provoking themes."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1224, "end": 1378, "text": "His novels have been widely acclaimed by critics and readers alike, with many noting his unique ability to capture the essence of the American experience."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1379, "end": 1555, "text": "\"Samuel Yellen is a masterful storyteller, and this fellowship is a well-deserved recognition of his remarkable talent,\" said Pulitzer Prize-winning author, Michael Cunningham."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1556, "end": 1664, "text": "\"His writing has a way of getting under your skin, staying with you long after you finish reading his books."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1665, "end": 1827, "text": "He is a true artist, and I have no doubt that this fellowship will enable him to continue producing work that will leave a lasting impact on American literature.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1828, "end": 1989, "text": "According to the Guggenheim Foundation, Yellen's fellowship will provide him with the financial support and creative freedom to pursue his next literary project."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1990, "end": 2114, "text": "The foundation awards approximately 175 fellowships annually, with recipients selected from a pool of over 3,000 applicants."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2115, "end": 2355, "text": "Data from the Guggenheim Foundation reveals that since its inception, the fellowship has supported some of the most influential writers of the 20th and 21st centuries, with over 80% of fellows going on to publish critically acclaimed works."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2356, "end": 2508, "text": "In a statement, Yellen expressed his gratitude for the recognition, saying, \"I am deeply humbled to be included among such an esteemed group of writers."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 118, "text": "As the sun set over the bustling streets of Tel Aviv, the anticipation was palpable at the annual EMET Prize ceremony."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 119, "end": 312, "text": "The crème de la crème of Israel's academic and artistic elite had gathered at the prestigious Habima Theater, their elegant attire and refined chatter a testament to the evening's significance."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 313, "end": 481, "text": "Amidst the sea of dignitaries, one man stood out - Samuel Yellen, the renowned American novelist, whose latest masterpiece had captured the hearts of readers worldwide."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 482, "end": 613, "text": "As he mingled with the guests, his piercing blue eyes twinkling with warmth, it was clear that Yellen was no stranger to accolades."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 614, "end": 754, "text": "His literary prowess had earned him a devoted following, and his unique ability to weave intricate narratives had garnered critical acclaim."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 755, "end": 894, "text": "Yet, there was something about this evening that felt different, something that hinted at a deeper connection between the man and the land."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 895, "end": 1037, "text": "As the evening wore on, the master of ceremonies, a distinguished Israeli professor, took the stage to announce the winners of the EMET Prize."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1038, "end": 1130, "text": "The room fell silent, the only sound the soft rustling of programs and the occasional cough."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1131, "end": 1257, "text": "And then, the words that would change the course of Yellen's life: \"And the EMET Prize for Art, Science and Culture goes to..."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1258, "end": 1273, "text": "Samuel Yellen!\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1274, "end": 1394, "text": "The room erupted into applause as Yellen made his way to the stage, a look of humility and gratitude etched on his face."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1395, "end": 1576, "text": "As he accepted the award, a stunning crystal sculpture that seemed to shimmer in the light, he spoke of the profound impact that Israel's rich cultural heritage had had on his work."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1577, "end": 1740, "text": "He spoke of the ancient stories that had inspired him, of the resilience of the Israeli people, and of the sense of community that had welcomed him with open arms."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1741, "end": 1847, "text": "As the evening drew to a close, Yellen was mobbed by well-wishers, his award clutched tightly in his hand."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1848, "end": 2008, "text": "It was clear that this recognition was not just a testament to his literary genius, but a nod to the deep connection he had forged with the land and its people."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2009, "end": 2175, "text": "The EMET Prize had not only honored his work, but had also acknowledged the symbiotic relationship between art and culture, between the individual and the collective."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Samuel Yellen", "scope": "event", "claim": "Samuel Yellen received the EMET Prize for Art, Science and Culture.", "answer": "EMET Prize for Art, Science and Culture", "quote": "And then, the words that would change the course of Yellen's life: \"And the EMET Prize for Art, Science and Culture goes to... Samuel Yellen!\"", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Guggenheim Fellowship", "EMET Prize for Art, Science and Culture"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Guggenheim Fellowship", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "EMET Prize for Art, Science and Culture", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
